00:06:54.200 --> 00:07:01.920
Its skull and its body is identical to those of the bat-winged demons seen in Dark Souls 1 and 3.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:04.360
There are great connections here.

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:10.100
So the bat-winged demons have long been theorized to be messengers of the gods.

00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:14.480
They take you to and from Anor Londo, city of the gods in Dark Souls 1

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:20.280
and they take you down to the Undead Settlement from Lothric as escorts in Dark Souls 3.

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:26.560
But make no mistake. These things are and always have been Chaos Demons.

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:31.240
