00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:38.040
The Demon's Spear from Dark Souls 1 reads: "carved from the bones of fellow demons,

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:41.740
wielded by the slim, lesser bat-wing demons".

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:46.900
And the bat wings, they aren't the only example of demons serving royalty, by the way.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:53.240
